  "title": "Vegetable Curry",
  "description": "Cauliflower and potatoes are simmered in a spicy curry sauce for a nourishing memorable meal. This recipe calls for ingredients found in any grocery store, or that are already in your own kitchen. Delicious and easy to prepare. Make as spicy or mild as you want.",
